{"v":1,"accession":"PRJDB4240","title":"WL Reactor published in ME","description":"The data is the whole sequence data for the \"Bacterial population dynamics in a laboratory activated sludge reactor monitored by pyrosequencing of 16S rRNA\", Satoh et al. (2013), Microbes and Environments, 28(1), 65-70.  Bacterial community change in a laboratory activated sludge reactor was analyzed by NGS for around 8 months.  A sudden disappearance of a major population was observed around day 50th, and periodical increase and recessions were observed for many of the observed OTUs.","center":"Mino/Satoh Laboratory, Department of Socio-cultural Environmental Studies, Graduate School of Frontier Sciences, The University of Tokyo","data_type":"Other","submission_date":"2017/09/19 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMD00041307","WL10_002","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2010-06-16",2010,"JP","Chiba",1859924,"Kashiwa","verified",35.9003,139.9334,"Japan:Kashiwa",null,"wastewater","aerobic","activated sludge","city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMD00041308","WL10_004","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2010-06-18",2010,"JP","Chiba",1859924,"Kashiwa","verified",35.9003,139.9334,"Japan:Kashiwa",null,"wastewater","aerobic","activated sludge","city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMD00041309","WL10_007","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2010-06-21",2010,"JP","Chiba",1859924,"Kashiwa","verified",35.9003,139.9334,"Japan:Kashiwa",null,"wastewater","aerobic","activated sludge","city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMD00041310","WL10_009","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2010-06-23",2010,"JP","Chiba",1859924,"Kashiwa","verified",35.9003,139.9334,"Japan:K